      "@id": "kt:autolaunched-flow",
      "@type": "kto:Feature",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Autolaunched Flow",
      "skos:definition": "The Flow Builder flow type that has no trigger of its own and no screens: it runs in the background only when something else starts it, such as a parent flow's Subflow element, Apex, a custom button, an Agentforce action or a REST API call.",
