      "@id": "kt:large-data-volumes",
      "@type": "kto:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Large Data Volumes",
      "skos:definition": "The architectural concern of running Salesforce orgs with very high user counts, record counts or storage (roughly tens of millions of records), where query selectivity, sharing calculation, data loading and deletion must be designed deliberately to keep the multitenant platform performant.",
